    "Self-contained calendar-year 2026 cycle, all 52 Sundays, January 4 - December 27, one entry per Sunday. The source's own \"Prayer Date\" column carries no liturgical/Proper labels anywhere in the document, so `liturgicalNote` is null on every entry.",
    "The source's table also has 'Clergy Contact' and 'Title' columns naming each congregation's clergy and their role -- these are out of scope for this schema (subjects are congregations/categories, not individuals) and were not transcribed.",
    "Every subject is a specific congregation except one: \"Belfry Episcopal & Lutheran Campus Ministry\" (Davis, Jan 18) is an ecumenical (Episcopal & Lutheran) campus ministry rather than an ordinary parish church. The source lists it in the same table row format as every other congregation, with its own City ('Davis') filled in exactly like a parish entry, so it is transcribed here as `type: \"parish\"` (place \"Davis\") rather than `category` -- a judgment call, disclosed here since the source itself does not label it either way.",
